 Republicans in congress to visit Dr. Paul&#39;s office and ask his what it was he was saying when he was right about everything and they were wrong.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I hope nobody is holding their breath waiting for that to happen though.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116300400957261207/comments/default/116302177239556298'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116300400957261207/comments/default/116302177239556298'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/wave-that-wasnt-and-one-that-was.html?showComment=1163021760000#c116302177239556298' title=''/><author><name>Scott Horton</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01116092532788350282</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/wave-that-wasnt-and-one-that-was.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116300400957261207' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116300400957261207' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1140864807"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 8, 2006 at 2:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116301512579111249</id><published>2006-11-08T12:45:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-11-08T12:45:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>will,interesting piece.  got a buddy who said that...</title><content type='html'>will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;interesting piece.  got a buddy who said that if the dems take congress then the guns laws are a coming.  funny that ron paul recently wrote a piece on how the dems have not forgotten about the little gun snatching schemes.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;as far as the NRA is concerned, vin suprynovicz is right IMO--the NRA has supported every piece of anti-gun legislation since it&#39;s inception.  and IMO, that&#39;s a reason why no one should support it. my buddy keeps saying that the NRA&#39;s compromising has resulted in less odorous legislation. :-O  maybe so, but to compromise is to concede defeat.  i&#39;d rather die on principle than live in defeat.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;as for the JBS, i hope it comes around.  so sad.  &quot;making friends of the baser sort&quot; will not get it far because it will get it no where.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;so, i guess we get to see how the NRA caters to the dems?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116300400957261207/comments/default/116301512579111249'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116300400957261207/comments/default/116301512579111249'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/wave-that-wasnt-and-one-that-was.html?showComment=1163015100000#c116301512579111249' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/wave-that-wasnt-and-one-that-was.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116300400957261207' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116300400957261207' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 8, 2006 at 12:45 PM"/></entry></feed>